    role: 'Software Engineer',
    image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535713875002-d1d0cf377fde?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&ixid=MnwxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1180&q=80',
    text: 'WickedBlocks has transformed how I build web interfaces. The components are intuitive and save me a lot of time.'
  },
  {
    name: 'Emily Clark',
    role: 'UI/UX Specialist',
    image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511367461989-f85a21fda167?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1180&q=80',
    text: 'The flexibility of WickedBlocks is unmatched. It has made my design process much smoother and more efficient.'
  },
  {
    name: 'David Kim',
    role: 'Full Stack Developer',
    image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517841905240-472988babdf9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1180&q=80',
    text: 'WickedBlocks offers a wide range of components that are easy to customize. It’s my go-to resource for new projects.'
  },
  {
    name: 'Olivia Martinez',
    role: 'Web Developer',
    image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519125323398-675f0ddb6308?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1180&q=80',
    text: 'I appreciate the attention to detail in every component. WickedBlocks has saved me countless hours.'
  },
  {
    name: 'Chris Evans',
    role: 'Backend Engineer',
    image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508214751196-bcfd4ca60f91?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1180&q=80',
    text: 'Integrating WickedBlocks into our workflow was seamless. The documentation is clear and the components are robust.'
  },
  {
